{"sections":[{"slug":"连续上同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"连续上同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">连续上同调</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“连续上同调”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">连续上同调是用连续上圈定义的上同调</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或连续函数层的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由长正合列</span>\n$$\r\n\\dots \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{Z}) \\to H^2(X, \\mathbb{R}) \\to H^2(X, U(1)) \\to H^3(X, \\mathbb{Z}) \\to H^3(X, \\mathbb{R}) \\to \\dots\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">可得连续上同调</span> $H^2(X,U(1))$ <span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> $H^3(X,\\mathbb{R})$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/奇异上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">奇异上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}